===Proper noun===
{{en-proper noun}}

# {{context|chiefly|British|lang=en}} a [[malted]] [[milk]] [[hot]] [[bedtime]] [[drink]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|Horlicks}}

# {{context|euphemistic|chiefly|UK|slang|lang=en}} [[bollocks]] – a [[muddle]], [[hash]] or [[balls-up]]

===Verb===
